- pages(page_id, sys_id, buckets, n_chars, text, provenance, ...).
- Runs on data/fullcorpus_v2.db AFTER the overnight chain finishes
  (~250-300K tier-A rows, ~1.5-1.9M tier-B rows, 667K pages).

## Review focus
