 114: 
 115:     - margin-band isotonic knots per (band, length-bin) where fitted;
 116:     - singleton band: decoy-anchored null P = 1 - DecoyBestCDF(len, dens)
 117:       (FRAG2-PLAN singleton finding: the band is unfittable from synthetic
 118:       crops; the chunk-shuffle decoys' best-candidate-density distribution IS
 119:       the chance-singleton null);
 120:     - fallback: pooled per-length isotonic.
 121:     Length feature: nearest calibrated length bin by the row's ALIGNED length
 122:     (calibration crops are fully covered, alen ~= crop len; documented
 123:     approximation for partially-covered pages).
 124:     """
 125: 
 126:     def __init__(self, path):
 127:         d = json.load(open(path, encoding='utf-8'))
 128:         self.meta = d.get('meta', {})
